Node ID=50 Linripper
Text=Well, if I told you, it wouldn't be secr--Oh, what's the harm, eh? I happened upon a very old blade that fells even the hardiest goblin. It has a history, that's for sure, because the goblins fear it by sight. They call it Glinripper, among other things, but I like to call it my early retirement. A few hundred more goblin scalps and I'll be able to buy a nice villa and settle down in the country.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
